reason: bufio synthetic package fails at import with WS E backend error "binary.fields: interface conversion needs type ids" during Java AST build (NodeFactory.maybeConvert). All compress/* packages depend on bufio.NewReader. Multiple WS D/G issues in bufio were fixed (min/max builtins, ScanLines 3-result, StarExpr assignments, strings.Builder, selector LHS in desugar), but the WS E binary-expression limitation is a deep frontend/backend issue not fixable in the synthetic source.
retest: when the WS E "interface conversion needs type ids" backend limitation is fixed for binary expressions with interface operands (phase1 NodeFactory.maybeConvert), rebuild gofrontend and re-run ./run_wave3.sh compress/<pkg>.
